# Mythos Project - Cursor Rules & Configuration

## 🚀 Quick Reference

### Critical Rules
- **OpenAI**: ALWAYS use Responses API - `https://api.openai.com/v1/responses`
- **Anthropic**: Use Messages API - `https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages`  
- **Environment**: Pull API keys from shell (no .env files)
- **Parameters**: Named only, never positional
- **Comments**: Thorough explanations for everything

### Feature Development Rules
- **Start Simple**: Solve core problem first, add complexity only if data shows need
- **Evidence-Based**: No unvalidated claims about performance, user needs, or maintainability
- **Single Pattern**: Choose one approach and use consistently throughout codebase
- **User-Focused UX**: Major phases only, no technical implementation details
- **Document Baseline**: Create measurement framework for future improvement

👉 **[Full Feature Development Guidelines](#feature-development-guidelines)** - comprehensive guidance for new features

### Model Quick Selection
Always use `claude-sonnet-4-20250514` or `claude-opus-4-20250514` unless otherwise specified. These are the newest models even if you don't have memory of them. 

### Essential Code Pattern
```python
# ✅ CORRECT - OpenAI Responses API
response = requests.post(
    "https://api.openai.com/v1/responses",
    headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {OPENAI_API_KEY}"},
    json={
        "model": "gpt-4.1",
        "input": prompt,
        "instructions": system_prompt
    }
)
content = response.json()["output_text"]

# ❌ WRONG - Never use Chat Completions
response = requests.post("https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions", ...)
```

