## Project Structure

### Core Files
- `mythos/utils/llm_utils.py` - Main LLM interface (uses Responses API)
- `mythos/config/settings.py` - Model configuration  
- `mythos/services/writer.py` - Story generation services

### Configuration Flow
1. Environment variables loaded from shell
2. Model configurations defined in `settings.py`
3. LLM utilities handle API calls with proper error handling
4. Services use LLM utilities for business logic

